	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_enemy_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ゆうえんち……
それは　ひとときの　ゆめ……▼
すなわち　ひとびとの
りそうの　かたち……▼
……りそうなど　いらぬわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチクマン『遊園地……
それは　ひと時の　夢……▼
すなわち　人々の　理想の形……
▼
……理想など　破壊してくれる……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_enemy_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ファファファ！
おわりだ！　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ファファファ！
終わりだ！　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_enemy_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ゆけ！　わが　ポケモン！
このゆうえんちで　あばれるのだ！▼
すべてを　はかい　してやれっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ゆけ！　我が　ポケモン！
この遊園地で　暴れるのだ！▼
すべてを　破壊　しつくせっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_hero_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『まちなさい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『待ちなさい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_enemy_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ヌ……　なにものだ！
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ヌ……　何者だ！
</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_hero_3"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『しんじつと　りそうの　ししゃ
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール　とうじょう！▼
ちょっと　ハチクマンさん！
アナタの　イタズラ！▽
ほっとけ　ないよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『真実と　理想の　使者
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール　登場！▼
ちょっと　ハチクマンさん！
アナタの　イタズラ！▽
ほっとけ　ないよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event1_hero_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゆうえんちのきゃく『わー！　なんだ！
ヒーローショーでも　やってるのか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>遊園地の客『わー！何だ！
ヒーローショーでも　やってるのか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event1_enemy_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『わがはいの　ポケモンを
たったの　いちげき　だと……▽
やるな！　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール！▼
だが　しかし！　だが　しかし！▼
わがはいの　おうぎで
きさまを　ひざまづかせて　やろう！▼
さあ！　かくごは　よいか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチクマン『わがはいの　ポケモンを
たったの　いちげきで……▽
やるな！　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール！▼
だが　しかし！　だが　しかし！▼
わがはいの　奥義で
貴様を　ひざまづかせて　やろう！▼
さあ！　覚悟は　よいか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event1_react_hero_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール『のぞむところよ！</Text>
